msgid "HobbyKing Hydropro Inception"
msgstr "HobbyKing Hydropro Inception"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:10
#: 1f51dc3b0a054094a41b7697d66e4ea4
msgid ""
"The HobbyKing HydroPro Inception is a high speed (over 11 m/s) electric "
"powerboat."
msgstr "HobbyKing HydroPro Inception 是一款高速（超过 11 m/s）电动快艇。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:13
#: 0fbd0c5b8614428bbf2fc4cc66af6253
msgid "Parts List"
msgstr "零件清单"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:15
#: 1676aeaf2220487a83caf9922153a5fd
msgid ""
"`HobbyKing HydroPro Inception <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/alpha-1000mm-"
"rtr.html>`__ (discontinued but the `Super Surge Crusher "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/super-surge-crusher-90a-twin-hull-"
"brushless-r-c-boat-730mm-arr.html>`__ may be similar)"
msgstr ""
"`HobbyKing HydroPro Inception <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/alpha-1000mm-"
"rtr.html>`__ （已停产，`Super Surge Crusher <https://hobbyking.com/en_us"
"/super-surge-crusher-90a-twin-hull-brushless-r-c-boat-730mm-arr.html>`__ "
"可能是类似替代品）"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:16
#: 0b26db9441e6419e948026703ae38294
msgid ""
"two `Nano-Tech 4S 4000mAh batteries <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-"
"nano-tech-4000mah-4s-30c-lipo-pack-wxt60.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"两块 `Nano-Tech 4S 4000mAh 电池 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/turnigy-nano-"
"tech-4000mah-4s-30c-lipo-pack-wxt60.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:17
#: 644d76253ecd4659b2a3555b46cacb4a
msgid ""
"`XT60 Y-cable <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/xt60-harness-for-2-packs-in-"
"parallel-1pc-2.html>`__ to connect batteries in parallel"
msgstr ""
"`XT60 并联 Y 型线 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/xt60-harness-for-2-packs-in-"
"parallel-1pc-2.html>`__，用于并联连接电池"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:18
#: ee6b750b795f401db67558f3316779f3
msgid ""
"`Holybro Pixfalcon <http://www.holybro.com/product/8>`__ with `GPS "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/ublox-micro-m8n-gps-compass-module-"
"1pc.html>`__ and `telemetry <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/holybro-"
"telemetry-radio-v3-100mw-915mhz.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"`Holybro Pixfalcon <http://www.holybro.com/product/8>`__，配 `GPS "
"<https://hobbyking.com/en_us/ublox-micro-m8n-gps-compass-module-"
"1pc.html>`__ 和 `数传 <https://hobbyking.com/en_us/holybro-telemetry-"
"radio-v3-100mw-915mhz.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:19
#: fdb6d9c61d654180930a8f281679e7d8
msgid ""
"6 channel (or more) transmitter like the `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"
msgstr ""
"6 通道（或更多）发射机，如 `Futaba T10J "
"<https://www.futabarc.com/systems/futk9200-10j/index.html>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:21
#: 6a7d8baf867143b6b023dc2d2eb99294
msgid ""
"The inside of the vehicle becomes a bit wet during operation so it is "
"important to take steps to keep the electronics dry."
msgstr "车辆内部在运行时会有些进水，因此必须采取措施保持电子设备干燥。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:23
#: f5e6b1c8ad7c433b9d93a8057c473e3f
msgid ""
"For this build a 3cm x 10cm rectangular hole was cut on the underside of "
"the removable cover which stretches from the blacked out windscreen at "
"the front to the black hook-like knob at the back.  The RC receiver, "
"autopilot, GPS and telemetry radio were inserted through the hole and "
"then attached using 3M double sided adhesive foam. The 3cm x 10cm hole "
"was then closed using duct tape."
msgstr ""
"本次组装在可拆卸舱盖底面（从前部磨砂挡风玻璃延伸至后部黑色钩形旋钮）开了一个 3cm x 10cm 的矩形孔。RC 接收机、飞控、GPS "
"和数传通过该孔插入，然后用 3M 双面泡棉胶固定。3cm x 10cm 的开孔随后用胶带封闭。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:25
#: 96fec52a40384503a80d6ad17fa9ad63
msgid ""
"The battery power module was left in the main open area of the frame but "
"partially protected from getting wet using a red balloon that came with "
"the set (intended for use with the RC receiver)."
msgstr "电池电源模块留在机架主开放区域，用套装附带的红色气球（原本用于 RC 接收机）进行部分防水保护。"

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hydropro-inception.rst:30
#: f5cab9a0b5c748c788efc1a046fcffb3
msgid "Firmware used: Rover-3.5.0"
msgstr "固件版本：Rover-3.5.0"

