msgid ""
"This parameter file can also be loaded using the Mission Planner's "
"Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter Tree page by selecting \"HK-"
"HydroProInception-Rover350\" from the drop down on the middle right and "
"then push the \"Load Presaved\" button."
msgstr ""
"此参数文件也可通过 Mission Planner 的「Config/Tuning >> Full Parameter "
"Tree」页面加载，从右中部下拉菜单选择「HK-HydroProInception-Rover350」，然后点击「Load "
"Presaved」按钮。"

